# downloaded/derived data caches (large; regenerable via pipeline/)
data/
# meshes are large and regenerable; renders/reports stay in history
*.stl
*.3mf
# ...but the Bambu PROJECT file is the exception that rule did not
# anticipate: it is hand-authored slicer state, not build output, and
# nothing in pipeline/ can regenerate it. It carries the print profile
# verbatim -- including the per-part water-only ironing scope, which is
# painful to reproduce from prose -- so it IS the print guide. Keep it.
!cali regions.3mf
__pycache__/
*.pyc
